# Control design (DEP-*)

Normative deploy engine rules live here as **DEP-*** docs (e.g. DEP-002 boot-secrets, DEP-004 deploy-stack driver, DEP-005 plane split).

- Data-plane copies with CFG IDs may live under **homelab-config** `docs/design/homelab-control/` — keep behavior and docs aligned in the same change when both repos move.
- Boot-secrets: control runs renders; data supplies **`config/boot-secrets.yml`** lists only (no data-repo orchestration in control).

When changing documented **MUST** behavior, update the DEP doc and homelab-config contract tests that reference it in the data PR (or paired PRs).
